      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST LIKE NUGGET (2) has been racing well of late. Finished fourth at his latest appearance over 1700m at Horsham, beaten 4 metres. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. BANGBANG BOBBIE (11) broke last start and finished 17 metres from the winner in fifth over 1660m at Hamilton in an inauspicious start to his career. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. Only needs to get things right to be in contention. OBSIDIAN FLO (4) is at the track for the first time. By Cullens Hope and hails from the Jim Barker stable. Placed in a recent trial. Capable of taking this out. BETTING ATTACK (3) disappointed last time when seventh over 2180m at Stawell. Can do a lot better so is worth considering.",
